Let $a = -1 - 3i$ and $b = 7 + 8i.$  Then $z$ lies on the circle centered at $a$ with radius 1, and $w$ lies on the circle centered at $b$ with radius 3.

[asy]
unitsize (0.4 cm);

pair A, B, Z, W;

A = (-1,-3);
